@host = http://localhost:8080

### Duplicate response rotation
GET {{host}}/rotation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "behavior": "duplicate method and URL responses rotate in file order"
}

### Default Strategy 1
GET {{host}}/default
Content-Type: application/json

{ "n":  1 }

### Default Strategy 2
GET {{host}}/default
Content-Type: application/json

{ "n":  2 }

### [202] Status variant
GET {{host}}/status-variant
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accepted": true }
